        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/theark/scene_magpie.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 0a5a934a-2357-4de7-87d8-6c6aac606a28).Image",
        "Description": "Hello Munga,\r\rThis upcoming Saturday is my prom! The theme for this year&apos;s prom is masquerade. It just so happens that the Isle of Sgail has a similar celebration this time of year. So we are going to visit them this evening (I apologize for this map in advance).\r\rThe five jabronies we are to eliminate today have threatened to pour hot sauce down the front of my suit and ruin it, and I need to be looking dapper for this upcoming weekend.\r\rDon&apos;t let them do me dirty like that. Best of luck.",
